#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:2 96e18713cef9461698bdfb95a65aa9b3
msgid "_`Speed step`"
msgstr "_`速度阶跃`"

#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:4 e8ea9973db514f98ab74664450c6bbe9
msgid "The speed reference steps 0 → 100 rad/s while the current loop stays at 20 kHz. The outer loop saturates iq, the plant accelerates, and the loop pulls back before the reference is reached — the classic cascade behaviour."
msgstr "速度给定从 0 阶跃到 100 rad/s，电流环保持在 20 kHz。外环把 iq 顶到饱和，plant 加速，环在到达给定前收回——典型的级联行为。"

#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:13 bf53d2c6f2584e1b87d10d78483971c1
msgid "Speed reaches the setpoint in about 70 ms; iq saturates during the ramp and collapses to the friction-compensating value once the speed settles"
msgstr "速度在约 70 ms 内到达给定；iq 在爬升段饱和，速度稳定后跌落到抵消摩擦的值"

#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:16 83803a363de340ca8e5a8032de185595
msgid "measured on the step"
msgstr "阶跃段测得"

