#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:20 789d67836e194b7bb14f06840e5f52be
msgid "What to look for: iq hits its limit during the ramp (the loop is doing the right thing, not fighting itself), a small overshoot, and a steady-state error well inside one percent."
msgstr "看点：爬升时 iq 打到限幅（说明环在做对的事，而不是自己跟自己较劲）、超调很小、稳态误差远小于百分之一。"
